{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8d44f3db-ba13-8c36-b319-12cd418719ef",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T14:21:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anabela Rocha",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:19:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:19:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Rosa. I am calling about animals. Feral cats. A whole colony of them, near the dumpsters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:19:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can take that down. Where are the dumpsters? What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:19:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 370 Rhode Island Avenue. The dumpsters are behind the building, in the back lot. Three-seventy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:20:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three seventy Rhode Island Avenue, got it. About how many cats are you seeing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:20:11-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I count at least, at least, eight. Maybe more at night. They have been there longer, but since the nor'easter last weekend, Saturday into Sunday, there are more of them. They are looking for shelter by the bins."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:20:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Makes sense, they'll go wherever it's out of the wind. Are any of them hurt, or acting aggressive?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:20:35-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I have seen. But I am worried. There are children, children, who walk through that lot to get to the bus. I do not want anyone scratched or bitten."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:20:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put this in as a report for animal control so an officer can look at it. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:20:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anabela Rocha. A-N-A-B-E-L-A. Rocha, R-O-C-H-A. Please check it when you type. The autocorrect on my phone keeps changing names, so I have learned to spell everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:21:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No autocorrect here. Anabela Rocha, R-O-C-H-A. And a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:21:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0185. That is my landline."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:21:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, 401-555-0185. I'm sending this over now. Someone from animal control should call you back, and they may want to come out and look at the lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:21:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you, Rosa. That is all I need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:21:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Rocha. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T14:21:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
